{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "沟通的定义", "content": "沟通不是把观点植入对方脑子，而是提供渠道了解对方内心世界和想法，通过交换想法（我听你的，你听我的）达到信息和思想交换，可能对彼此产生影响。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["沟通", "定义"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e20c762aae0b", "blocks": ["b00001", "b00002", "b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "legacy:nl-c-15", "kind": "complements", "condition": "均适用于定义沟通本质时；旧原子包含年龄阶段沟通方式，候选只提供定义部分。", "reason": "候选详细阐述沟通是交换想法而非植入观点，补充旧原子前半部分。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e20c762aae0b-c001:u001"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
