{"type": "concept", "subtype": "condition", "title": "沟通必要条件：父母情绪健康", "content": "沟通的必要条件是父母情绪健康。生完孩子后妈妈特别是妈妈有很大危险产后抑郁，因为荷尔蒙情况，这会影响与孩子的沟通。在这几年父母自己带孩子时可能最崩溃最累，因此必须注意父母自己的情绪健康。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["情绪健康", "产后抑郁", "沟通条件"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a013", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e20c762aae0b", "blocks": ["b00012", "b00013"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a001", "kind": "prerequisite", "condition": "父母情绪健康是沟通的必要条件", "reason": "父母情绪健康是进行有效沟通的前提，因此是沟通定义中信息交换能够实现的基础。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-15", "kind": "complements", "condition": "均适用于沟通前提条件；旧原子limits提到父母情绪健康，候选展开说明。", "reason": "候选具体解释父母情绪健康为何是沟通必要条件，补充旧原子限制。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-r-04", "kind": "complements", "condition": "共同适用：所有年龄沟通的前提；旧原子限制中已提及父母情绪健康", "reason": "候选强调父母情绪健康是沟通必要条件，补充旧原子限制条款，尤其产后抑郁风险。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e20c762aae0b-c001:u013"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "0-3岁沟通方法一：减少分心", "content": "在孩子0-3岁阶段，父母应减少分心，不要在孩子旁边放手机、看电视等分散注意力，即使孩子不会讲话或不太理解，耳边一直听到声音也是好的沟通开始。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["减少分心", "沟通方法", "0-3岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a014", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e20c762aae0b", "blocks": ["b00013", "b00014", "b00015"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a004", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "减少分心是话唠式沟通的方法之一", "reason": "a014提出减少分心是0-3岁沟通方法，属于话唠式沟通的具体步骤", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e20c762aae0b-c001:u014"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "0-3岁沟通方法二：给孩子时间思考", "content": "孩子反映事情需要较长时间，因为大脑突触和理解认知有限。父母要给孩子时间思考，例如再等五秒钟或十秒钟，特别是急性子父母要注意。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["等待", "思考时间", "沟通方法", "0-3岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a015", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e20c762aae0b", "blocks": ["b00015", "b00016"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a004", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "给孩子时间思考是话唠式沟通的方法之一", "reason": "a015提出给孩子时间思考是0-3岁沟通方法，属于话唠式沟通的具体步骤", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e20c762aae0b-c001:u015"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "0-3岁沟通方法三：提问并给孩子时间回答", "content": "父母应特别注意孩子感兴趣的东西，通过提问启发沟通，并给孩子时间回答。例如洗澡时放玩具小鸭，问“这是小鸭子吗？它在游泳吗？”等。常见错误是一边给孩子洗澡却不讲话、只注重动作，很少与孩子沟通。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["提问", "等待回答", "沟通方法", "0-3岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a016", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e20c762aae0b", "blocks": ["b00016", "b00017", "b00018"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-2", "relations": [{"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a015", "kind": "supports", "condition": "提问后需要等待回答", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "提问并给孩子时间回答的沟通方法，支持了给孩子时间思考的必要性。", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}, {"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a004", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "提问并给孩子时间回答是话唠式沟通的方法之一", "reason": "0-3岁沟通方法三（提问并给孩子时间回答）是0-3岁沟通关键词“话唠”的具体实施步骤之一。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "supported", "review_notes": ""}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e20c762aae0b-c001:u016"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "anti-pattern", "subtype": "counterexample", "title": "父母替孩子说完话的错误做法", "content": "孩子思维慢、语言组织表达慢，父母容易替孩子说完话。当孩子学说话时，应给他时间找到合适词语，不要替他说完。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["替孩子说话", "错误做法", "0-3岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a017", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e20c762aae0b", "blocks": ["b00019"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a015", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "与给孩子时间思考相反", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a015", "kind": "contrasts", "condition": "父母替孩子说完话与给孩子时间思考相反", "reason": "a017指出父母替孩子说完话是错误的，而a015强调给孩子时间思考，两者做法相反", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e20c762aae0b-c001:u017"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "不打扰孩子说话", "content": "孩子说话慢，可能玩一玩别的再想一想，父母不要另辟话题，要等到确定孩子讲的话已经说完。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["不打扰", "等待", "沟通方法", "0-3岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a018", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e20c762aae0b", "blocks": ["b00019", "b00020"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a015", "kind": "supports", "condition": "等待孩子说完", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a015", "kind": "supports", "condition": "不打扰孩子说话是给孩子时间思考的延伸", "reason": "a018建议不打扰孩子说话，等待孩子说完，支持a015给孩子时间思考的观点", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e20c762aae0b-c001:u018"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "case", "subtype": "case", "title": "用唱歌方式让祷告变得有趣的案例", "content": "讲师有信仰，睡前与孩子一起祷告，但孩子流于形式。后来改用唱歌方式，把祷告编成歌，随意编旋律，孩子觉得有趣，还会自己编歌。目的是让孩子喜欢与人沟通，觉得沟通是有意思、好玩的事情，而不是负担和疲倦。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["唱歌", "祷告", "有趣沟通", "案例"], "evidence": "reported_case", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a019", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e20c762aae0b", "blocks": ["b00020", "b00021", "b00022"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a016", "kind": "association", "condition": "通过有趣方式促进沟通", "evidence": "source_extraction", "reason": "用唱歌方式让祷告变得有趣的案例与0-3岁沟通方法三（提问并给孩子时间回答）都涉及促进幼儿沟通，但前者强调让沟通有趣，后者强调提问和等待，两者无直接支持关系。", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "原 supports 关系不成立，案例不能直接支持该具体方法，修订为 association。"}, {"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a020", "kind": "example_of", "condition": "唱歌方式让祷告有趣，实现让孩子喜欢沟通的目的", "reason": "a019是用唱歌方式让祷告有趣的案例，体现了a020让孩子喜欢与人沟通的目的", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e20c762aae0b-c001:u019"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "method", "title": "0-3岁沟通目的：让孩子喜欢与人沟通", "content": "0-3岁沟通的目的是让孩子喜欢与人沟通，觉得沟通是有意思、好玩的事情，而不是负担和疲倦。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["阶段与角色"], "tags": ["沟通目的", "0-3岁"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a020", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e20c762aae0b", "blocks": ["b00021", "b00022"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a004", "kind": "supports", "condition": "让孩子喜欢沟通是话唠式沟通的目的", "reason": "a020指出0-3岁沟通目的是让孩子喜欢与人沟通，支持a004话唠式沟通的最终目标", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e20c762aae0b-c001:u020"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
{"type": "concept", "subtype": "distinction", "title": "沟通与听话的区别", "content": "沟通不是让孩子听话，而是双方交换想法、进入彼此世界，可能对彼此产生影响。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["界限"], "tags": ["沟通", "听话", "区别"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:r001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-e20c762aae0b", "blocks": ["b00003"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-e20c762aae0b-c001:a001", "kind": "supports", "condition": "进一步明确沟通定义", "evidence": "source_extraction"}, {"target": "legacy:nl-c-15", "kind": "complements", "condition": "均适用于区分沟通与听话时；候选强调沟通是进入彼此世界。", "reason": "候选从沟通与听话的区别角度进一步说明沟通的本质。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-e20c762aae0b-c001:u021"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
